# Fire Nation Engineer: "Raid - At the beginning of your end step, if you attacked this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on another target creature
# or Vehicle you control." On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with its Ornithopter: at the end step the Engineer itself, Bot2's Ornithopter and a Mox are
# refused as targets, and Smuggler's Copter, a Vehicle that is no creature, gets one counter (not two). On turn 5 nothing attacks, so the
# turn-3 attack does not count and the counter stays one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Fire Nation Engineer
Smuggler's Copter
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x23

